This is an original bounded HTTP client and graph adapter. It does not bundle
SpeechRecognition, LunaTranslator, vendor SDKs or models.

Open-source references reviewed for protocol interoperability:
SpeechRecognition, Copyright (c) 2014-, Anthony Zhang and contributors,
BSD-3-Clause, revision 8075e8f76acdac58fcf6ac41a104172f51349e98.
https://github.com/Uberi/speech_recognition
Reviewed the OpenAI-compatible WAV upload and Azure recognition interfaces.

LunaTranslator's Windows speech recognition was reviewed as a UI reference;
no GPL code is incorporated. Exact references are recorded in provenance.json.
The REST adapters are independently implemented against the documented protocols.

